    intro w hw
    simp only [Finset.mem_insert, Finset.mem_singleton] at hw
    rcases hw with rfl | rfl | rfl
    · exact ht.1
    · exact ht.2.1
    · exact ht.2.2.1
  exact epCon_burl_lift α β L _ Z' x y h hTL (by simp) (by simp) (Ne.symm ht.2.2.2.1) h3 Nf hNf
