/-- **C1 (a set with no new edge inside).** A burl of the split multigraph that does not
contain both outer ends of `a`, `b`, nor both outer ends of `c`, `d`, is a burl of `G` with a
cut of the same size. (`epSp_burl` is the case "neither the outer end of `a` nor that of `c`";
